          <p className="article-eyebrow">E-MTB GUIDES · ATLAS MOUNTAINS · MOROCCO</p>
          <h1>E-MTB Tours in Morocco: A Complete Rider&apos;s Guide</h1>
          <p className="article-deck">
            Electric mountain biking opens up new ways to explore Morocco&apos;s
            mountain landscapes. With pedal assistance on the climbs, riders
            can experience rugged tracks, remote valleys and memorable
            descents while still enjoying the physical and technical side of
            mountain biking. The key is choosing a suitable route and planning
            battery use, terrain, daily distance and support before setting
            off.
          </p>
