          <div className="article-author-note">
            <strong>Planning note</strong>
            <p>
              This guide provides general E-MTB trip-planning advice, not a
              live trail report or a guarantee of battery range. Confirm
              current route access, weather, bike specifications, charging
              facilities, support arrangements and tour inclusions for your
              exact dates.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
